stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> Closed: expiry observed with interval enabled / clear generation
    Closed --> Open: current failure and ReadyToTrip returns true
    Open --> HalfOpen: strict expiry observed by State, admission or completion
    HalfOpen --> HalfOpen: admit below budget or current success below threshold
    HalfOpen --> Open: current failure
    HalfOpen --> Closed: current success reaches threshold
    note right of Closed
      Expiry is unset or set by the interval.
      Classification and request work run outside the lock.
    end note
    note right of HalfOpen
      No expiry. Admission budget is per generation.
      Pending work is represented by caller-held continuations.
    end note
